  "dialogue": [
    {
      "id": "I01",
      "path": "I01.wav",
      "spoken_text": "Hi! Let's count Fibonacci numbers, and watch each new number take shape.",
      "duration_s": 4.213541666666667,
      "sha256": "20f686194e94c4ba892f69e4e58aa0a14fa76201283a1ccff46e845e9f505742"
    },
    {
      "id": "I02",
      "path": "I02.wav",
      "spoken_text": "We start with zero and one. These are our two starting values.",
      "duration_s": 3.5311666666666666,
      "sha256": "28dee23c66e8490be373b12dee16a0d4cf756cc3367b7b49120a2f1c6b18b1b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "I03",
      "path": "I03.wav",
      "spoken_text": "To make the next number, add the previous two. Then use the newest pair, and do it again.",
      "duration_s": 4.9155,
      "sha256": "8f7bb5ae539a7c6ac3dd4aba711c81a92f3110e8e14634b9c3ca652cb003fc51"
    },
    {
      "id": "I04",
      "path": "I04.wav",
      "spoken_text": "The small labels tell us each number's place. We start at F zero, so F two is the third entry.",
      "duration_s": 6.0852916666666665,
      "sha256": "505c494fb5c0df00e82fb1beb80599afd42ca7be0983fdebd7277723b14428da"
    },
    {
      "id": "I05",
      "path": "I05.wav",
      "spoken_text": "The older value sits on the left. The newer value sits beside it. Their labels move with them.",
      "duration_s": 5.413541666666666,
      "sha256": "92c305138135ae19fc82b76dbcbaf0acef390768e56b0468f2ff4c3ecf956e5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "I06",
      "path": "I06.wav",
      "spoken_text": "Listen for plus and equals. The answer appears when we say its name, and becomes our newest value.",
      "duration_s": 5.929916666666666,
      "sha256": "a7773cb89f06c3fde6775e7d2e0d5c8ee7722d752d45b059a5329e435dda297e"
    },
    {
      "id": "I07",
      "path": "I07.wav",
      "spoken_text": "Number windows show values, not piles of things. A window marked one thousand stands for that value, not one thousand objects.",
      "duration_s": 7.973416666666667,
      "sha256": "b74cf59846384eceb6fbdd98d0c570e7857597bb34ab402a603d6868734f987a"
    },
    {
      "id": "I08",
      "path": "I08.wav",
      "spoken_text": "We'll keep adding until the sequence first passes one hundred million. The numbers grow, but the rule stays the same.",
      "duration_s": 6.700666666666667,
      "sha256": "8a89afcbdced59de06ddba0bcdcb1c1d3e714d3a6ef7fe1414cc18ba70f1ac8e"
    },
    {
      "id": "N000",
      "path": "N000.wav",
      "spoken_text": "zero",
      "duration_s": 0.5792916666666666,
      "sha256": "05819d82a70f5a2415d48ba2a170cc178613356f3a67eaf6a64cdb357ca5c2e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "N001",
      "path": "N001.wav",
      "spoken_text": "one",
      "duration_s": 0.48791666666666667,
      "sha256": "e3ca22e7b81f8994d4d9482fa8cb00aa33eeabfd9fa156135baa90d0aff962cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "E002",
      "path": "E002.wav",
      "spoken_text": "zero plus one equals",
      "duration_s": 1.476125,
      "sha256": "7bee1155a26c5af503df78681892804d234fe3cbc7bf18e9a32e8193ed695ecc"
    },
    {
      "id": "N002",
      "path": "N002.wav",
      "spoken_text": "one",
      "duration_s": 0.48791666666666667,
      "sha256": "e3ca22e7b81f8994d4d9482fa8cb00aa33eeabfd9fa156135baa90d0aff962cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "T002a",
      "path": "T002a.wav",
      "spoken_text": "There are two ones in a row. One is a starting value; the next was made by adding zero and one.",
      "duration_s": 5.496208333333334,
      "sha256": "367552aaef0121fb0b2ee1cf95220815ceb79d18bb4ea7efbc9bafe2d65792b3"
    },
    {
      "id": "T002b",
      "path": "T002b.wav",
      "spoken_text": "They have the same value, but different places. Keep both entries, because each belongs to the sequence.",
      "duration_s": 6.1154166666666665,
      "sha256": "fc2d825c9f1be4afacadb2f210d14ec32cbe3f189b7db184174380fe17759af1"
    },
